{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_title", "source_sha256": "7752431b6edf60ac7a0024bca3a15fcc63b4926c982a5bfba11c8510186e56bc", "ja": "ここから、また！", "zh": "从这里，重新开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_synopsis", "source_sha256": "78189a61782bc8cd958b2138e2450b011d391854304028d49baaecfdd315fd0e", "ja": "年の瀬に行われる特別公演は、久しぶりの\n全員参加とあって、レッスンに準備にと\n余念がないアイドル達。プロデューサーは\n今年も来年も、こうしてアイドルのみんなと\n大切な日々を重ねられるようにと願う。", "zh": "在岁末举办的特别演出难得迎来全体成员齐聚一堂，\n偶像们全心投入到了课程与筹备工作中。\n制作人默默祈愿，无论今年还是来年，\n都能像这样与所有的偶像们一起，\n度过每一个珍贵而充实的日子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1000_audience", "source_sha256": "6d8fb32cadd12aaf582ab17c274e0d96101b812f7436d221066ba2db766d1e3a", "ja": "ワアアアアアアッ！！！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6214d68468f984d8fcea4521dfe1133ef167e5873b5a19e4afe08ab36af36cab", "ja": "（力強い歓声がここまで聞こえてくる。\n掛け値なしに、素晴らしい公演だったな！）", "zh": "（响亮的欢呼声一直传到了这里。\n毫不夸张地说，真是一场精彩的演出啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "02caec66cbbf56827a6b7e305b4084c025632bd438976446f1f82f483cb00ac8", "ja": "終わったー！　やり切ったよ、\n{$P$}！　ねえ、どうだった！？", "zh": "结束啦！我已经全力以赴了，\n{$P$}！呐，感觉怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1003_p", "source_sha256": "824919d6370c8842aba0da57790d5daa7b7c5c6929023992d3be832df6d95e74", "ja": "ああ、素晴らしかったぞ！　劇場の歴史としても、\n誇れる公演の一つになったな！", "zh": "啊，太精彩了！这也成为了剧场历史上值得我们自豪的一场公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5aeeebc5131384e8550a1dbee6ab16e2cbb271e2c2db1d8de0abd41f52f0a5f5", "ja": "ホント！？　うう……\n今日までみんなで頑張ってきて良かったよ！", "zh": "真的吗！？　呜呜……\n大家一起努力到今天，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1a18a2342c4871087d27f01696f58bfa830e90ef1e72e625df2ae899c6131471", "ja": "全部、みんなで手作りでしたしね！\n感慨もひとしおって感じで……ぐすっ。", "zh": "全部都是大家亲手做的呢！\n感觉感慨特别深……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "ad9e28851fdf0703372a5bb12f6df7796caa7e19910e9fbf1b24044bfa9c1df3", "ja": "あ、フーカったら泣いてるー！　……でも、\nぐすっ。気持ちわかるヨー……！", "zh": "啊，风花居然哭了～！……不过，\n抽泣。我懂你的心情喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cf2f7e0c52cafe782aa17bb73dc6a5d78ce2a83ce50eee7abc83fdcd128165e7", "ja": "あはは、みんな泣いちゃって……ぐすっ。", "zh": "啊哈哈，大家都哭了……吸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0291f76a7c67e35a608b0dadce4404e9d782c88e3d3f442c1d05c2f1146e97b1", "ja": "{$P$}もじゃん！　あーもう、\nアタシたち泣き虫劇場だな！　……ううっ。", "zh": "{$P$}不也是嘛！啊真是的，\n我们这都成爱哭鬼剧场了啊！……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "16b294f6cb6dd48bacd33048a779679fbdb970420e90f617d6f8fa1ada083d39", "ja": "ぐすっ、そうだね歩……でも自分たち、\n泣き虫だけど、弱虫じゃないぞ！", "zh": "抽泣，我们也是这么想的，阿步……不过，我们虽然爱哭，可不是胆小鬼哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "0da86bec24c22a387e90e5ed90039616c9124116faf393f92466f2bc6950ad4b", "ja": "ひとりだと、まだちょっと緊張することもあるけど……\nほ、ホントに、たまにだぞ！？", "zh": "一个人的时候，偶尔还是会有点紧张，不过……\n这、这真的只是偶尔哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5382a0ba1053584eb0f30a1326576ed81a4f1b214f8e23a909828dbc28182016", "ja": "私も、ステージに立つ前はいつも怖くて……\nなのに、不思議と乗り越えられちゃうんだよね。", "zh": "我每次站上舞台前也都很害怕……\n可不知怎么的，总能克服过去呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1969e9ff72bb9ff62e0cb7732a592a8b509a09e058160fdb2188981dc812f768", "ja": "わかるよ。怖くて、心細くて……でもみんなと円陣を\n組んだ途端、「楽しもう！」って気持ちになるんだ！", "zh": "我懂的。既害怕，又不安……可只要和大家围成一圈\n打气，立刻就会产生“好好享受吧！”的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "27ec4b3e2bea64d0d56f40241f8c644aff90d2562bd9fb89623e22de48573903", "ja": "ワタシも、今日みたいにお客さんがいっぱいだと\n緊張するヨー。でも、みんなと一緒だからネ！", "zh": "我也是，像今天这样观众这么多的时候会紧张啦。可是，因为和大家在一起嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "41741fbc78410f487c5563ddbec470e0886803205f1059ff74c1b72f289c64d3", "ja": "そっか。みんな、同じ気持ちなんだね……。", "zh": "这样啊。大家的心情都一样呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9d07c5868efe49206ed4f38abdadd2e36c48e9c88effe75f12982b6649300ec8", "ja": "劇場には、色んなアイドルがいるけど。多かれ少なかれ\nそこは同じなんだろうって、見ててわかるよ。", "zh": "剧场里有各种各样的偶像，不过或多或少，大家在这一点上应该都是一样的。看着就能明白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "5754aee35fe4957940616307332c253f95a5cabad4debc2d2ce9c72114114d5a", "ja": "……もしかして、{$P$}も？\n自分たちと同じ気持ちだったりするの？", "zh": "……难道说，{$P$}也是？\n也有着和我们一样的心情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4275f9b11fc66a805574e38e429ce341abf5bdb36f973b8fb28f6289da15146d", "ja": "まあ、俺もそうだな。みんなのステージ前は、\nいつも緊張して……でも、怖くはない。", "zh": "嗯，我也一样啊。在大家上台之前，\n总是会紧张……不过，并不可怕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "d35cc8ec7b90162fb9a2ee5438a247e9b59f4c2820e969c612667f14d732bdb0", "ja": "怖くないノ？　……どうして？", "zh": "不会害怕吗？……为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8697b4a4c660750968403a04bbf685a2aa6e34a3900cc95851b03a2a6dfb4bf7", "ja": "うん。みんなならできるって、いつも信じてるからな。\n信じる事ができるのが、みんななんだ。", "zh": "嗯。因为我一直深信，是大家的话就一定能做到。\n因为大家，是值得去相信的存在啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b1adf40b1a591a5b4c82d79e5b543484aa596f6a23d152b2f40b426f35439c14", "ja": "……ぐすっ。うわーん！！", "zh": "……呜咽。哇——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1025_p", "source_sha256": "a9bb174adf7062cc47f4952d0315700740180182e34109cfc7bb046dbbfdc1e7", "ja": "うっ、余計に泣かせてしまった……み、みんな、\nお腹空いてないか？　ケータリングでも！", "zh": "呃，反而弄得哭得更厉害了……大、大家\n肚子饿不饿？要不要吃点外烩餐点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1026_p", "source_sha256": "928dc42c5c70ca515d35499e78b46f3e5f507077c148bc4ac91f8d19d24329bd", "ja": "今日のは、すごく美味しいんだぞ！　佐竹飯店が\n特別メニューを出前してくれたんだ！", "zh": "今天的特别好吃哦！佐竹饭店还特意送来了特别菜单！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "d7a148d364d7a364da702ab1303c81d7036df49e2c4d984dbe21ddaa9963f08c", "ja": "わ！　ミナコのとこ！？　やった♪\nワタシ、あれだーい好き！　早く食べに行こうヨ！", "zh": "哇！是美奈子的店！？太棒啦♪\n我最喜欢那个了！快点一起去吃吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "50de46c77c6c1f59183ae24952543eb3e5d2b050fa5f2b4d0897a98cfee5fa29", "ja": "あ、エレナ！　ずるいぞ、自分も食べたい！\n抜け駆け禁止だぞー！", "zh": "啊，艾蕾娜！太狡猾了，我也想吃！\n不许偷偷先去哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1029_p", "source_sha256": "a41088670578ed1d4754a2015ff723c429c017298891748c206f5275627f180d", "ja": "焦らなくても大丈夫。\nみんなで食べても、食べきれない量があるから！", "zh": "不用着急。\n就算大家一起吃，也还有多得吃不完的量呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1030_034ayu", "source_sha256": "80c56ea37f23edab59a98b0df140f641667555009be6615a6649ae8ac7fae67f", "ja": "ホントかな～？　アタシたち、今めっちゃお腹空いてる\nから！　いくら佐竹飯店といえども、足りないかもよ？", "zh": "真的吗～？我们现在可是饿得要命，\n就算是佐竹饭店，说不定也不够吃哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1031_p", "source_sha256": "7a0dc4f84d2d8ac129433606a70d7e10a99bf3a6d9ccc30568ced72082fa76e7", "ja": "それは心配ない。全員分オーダーしたら、\n5倍の量が届いたから……。", "zh": "那不用担心。给所有人点餐后，送来的量是5倍……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1032_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6601c46223af08712ba2e396145c2c2a1ef9c4bde93594cf04868d3e01d8b2aa", "ja": "えっ……ご、5倍！？\nそんなに食べたら、体重が……。", "zh": "诶……五、5倍！？吃那么多的话，体重会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1033_p", "source_sha256": "8702ed921381dd7d463a43a1c09f2e4755acf653695936f4d88ebf7876b75c4d", "ja": "まあまあ、今日くらいはいいじゃないか！\nダイエットは来年からって事で。", "zh": "好啦好啦，今天就放纵一下嘛！\n减肥什么的，就从明年开始吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1034_041fuk", "source_sha256": "332ecbdde716b3be0645ededba295c0a9c9e352157e61e073fb03b563b51411b", "ja": "うう……もうっ。じゃあ、うーんと食べちゃいますっ！\n太ったら、{$P$}さんのせいですよ！", "zh": "呜呜……真是的。那我就要大吃特吃啦！\n要是变胖了，可都是{$P$}先生的错哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_099_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_099_1035_p", "source_sha256": "4407c01e55d4715026b1e419ea1b2069261d2a25784aa954384ea38ba1d6dced", "ja": "せ、責任は持つよ……。", "zh": "我、我会负责的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
